<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  हिन्दी — the first translation, and the one that matters most.

  Written for a lorry driver rather than for an office: plain Hindi with the
  English words drivers actually use kept as they are — FASTag, PUC, RC, SOS —
  because translating a term nobody says would be less clear, not more.

  Kept deliberately informal in the second person (आप), which is how a driver is
  addressed respectfully in a cab, and short: these are read at a glance beside a
  running engine.
-->
<resources>
